.DS_Store

# CI definition is tracked at deploy/ci/ci.yml: the push token is a GitHub App
# without the `workflows` permission, so committing into .github/workflows/ is
# rejected by GitHub. Activate with `git add -f .github/workflows/ci.yml`
# (see deploy/ci/README.md) from a token that has the scope.
.github/workflows/ci.yml
